        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.595,
            0.086,
            0.796,
            0.102
          ],
          "content": "D、苯丙氨酸的密码子"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.146,
            0.114,
            0.47,
            0.131
          ],
          "content": "22. 催化 dUMP 转变为 dTMP 的酶是"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.176,
            0.141,
            0.344,
            0.158
          ],
          "content": "A、核苷酸还原酶"
